On Error Goto E
Synchro Off
Amal 1,"Let R0=5; Let RA=R0*3+2; Let R1=RA/4; Let R2=RA&6|1; Let R3=RA!255; Let R4=10-3*2; L: Let R5=R5+1; If R5<4 Jump L; For R6=1 To 3; Let R7=R7+R6; Next R6; Let R8=1=1; Let R9=3<>3; Pause; Let RB=RB+1; Jump M; Let RC=99; M: Let RD=7/0; Let RE=-5*-3; Let RF=$1F+R0; Pause; Pause; Let RG=RG+2; End; Let RH=1"
Amal On 1
For I=1 To 6
  Synchro
  Print #1,I;":";
  For R=0 To 9 : Print #1,Amreg(1,R); : Next R
  For R=0 To 7 : Print #1,Amreg(R); : Next R
  Print #1,Chanmv(1);Chanan(1);Movon(1)
Next I
Amal 2,"AU(If R0>2 Jump X; Let R1=R1+10; X: eXit; ); Let R0=R0+1; Pause; Jump A; A: Let R2=R2+1; Pause; Jump A"
Amal On 2
For I=1 To 6 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(2,0);Amreg(2,1);Amreg(2,2) : Next I
Amal 3,"AU(If R0=3 Direct Q; ); Let R0=R0+1; Pause; Jump B; B: Let R1=R1+1; Pause; Jump B; Q: Let R2=77; Pause; Jump Q"
Amal On 3
For I=1 To 6 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(3,0);Amreg(3,1);Amreg(3,2) : Next I
Amal 4,"Let R0=Z(15); Let R1=XM; Let R2=K1; Let R3=J0; Let R4=V(0); Let R5=XS(0,100); Let R6=YH(0,30); Let R7=O; Pause; Jump A; A: Let R8=R8+1; Pause; Jump A"
Amal On 4
Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(4,0)>=0;Amreg(4,0)<=15;Amreg(4,2);Amreg(4,3);Amreg(4,4);Amreg(4,5);Amreg(4,6);Amreg(4,7)
Amal Freeze 4 : Synchro : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(4,8) : Amal On 4 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(4,8)
Amal Off 4 : Synchro : Print #1,Amreg(4,8);Chanmv(4)
Amreg(1,3)=1234 : Amreg(5)=-77 : Print #1,Amreg(1,3);Amreg(5)
Amal Off : Synchro
Print #1,Chanmv(1);Chanmv(2);Chanmv(3)
Synchro On
Print #1,"end"
Goto FIN
E: Print #1,"error";Errn : Resume Next
FIN:
